#: ../../../source/ROS-Framework/interfaces/topics/Working-with-topics/Configuring-QoS-Overrides.rst:56
msgid "Enabling QoS overrides in code"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/ROS-Framework/interfaces/topics/Working-with-topics/Configuring-QoS-Overrides.rst:58
msgid ""
"To allow users to override QoS settings, the node author must opt in when "
"constructing the publisher or subscription. This opt-in process does not "
"change the QoS policy itself, but instead provides a way for users to change "
"the policy via a parameter file specified at execution time. You can enable "
"default reconfigurable policies (history, depth, and reliability) or specify "
"a custom list of policy kinds with an optional validation callback."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/ROS-Framework/interfaces/topics/Working-with-topics/Configuring-QoS-Overrides.rst:64
#: ../../../source/ROS-Framework/interfaces/topics/Working-with-topics/Configuring-QoS-Overrides.rst:288
#: ../../../source/ROS-Framework/interfaces/topics/Working-with-topics/Configuring-QoS-Overrides.rst:346
#: ../../../source/ROS-Framework/interfaces/topics/Working-with-topics/Configuring-QoS-Overrides.rst:362
msgid "C++"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/ROS-Framework/interfaces/topics/Working-with-topics/Configuring-QoS-Overrides.rst:66
msgid ""
"In C++, include the ``rclcpp/qos_overriding_options.hpp`` header. Set the "
"``qos_overriding_options`` field on ``rclcpp::PublisherOptions`` or "
"``rclcpp::SubscriptionOptions``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/ROS-Framework/interfaces/topics/Working-with-topics/Configuring-QoS-Overrides.rst:69
msgid ""
"#include \"rclcpp/logging.hpp\"\n"
"#include \"rclcpp/node.hpp\"\n"
"#include \"rclcpp/publisher.hpp\"\n"
"#include \"rclcpp/publisher_options.hpp\"\n"
"#include \"rclcpp/qos.hpp\"\n"
"#include \"rclcpp/qos_overriding_options.hpp\"\n"
"#include \"rclcpp/subscription.hpp\"\n"
"#include \"rclcpp/subscription_options.hpp\"\n"
"#include \"std_msgs/msg/string.hpp\"\n"
"#include \"std_msgs/msg/string.hpp\"\n"
"\n"
"class QosConfigurableNode : public rclcpp::Node\n"
"{\n"
"public:\n"
"  QosConfigurableNode()\n"
"  : Node(\"qos_configurable_node\")\n"
"  {\n"
"    // Configure publisher options to allow overriding default QoS policies "
"(history, depth, and reliability)\n"
"    rclcpp::PublisherOptions pub_opts;\n"
"    pub_opts.qos_overriding_options = "
"rclcpp::QosOverridingOptions::with_default_policies(\n"
"      [](const rclcpp::QoS & qos) {\n"
"        rclcpp::QosCallbackResult result;\n"
"        if (qos.depth() > 10u) {\n"
"          result.successful = false;\n"
"          result.reason = \"history depth must be 10 or less\";\n"
"          return result;\n"
"        }\n"
"        result.successful = true;\n"
"        return result;\n"
"      });\n"
"\n"
"    pub_ = this->create_publisher<std_msgs::msg::String>(\"chatter\", 10, "
"pub_opts);\n"
"\n"
"    // Configure subscription options to allow overriding default QoS "
"policies (history, depth, and reliability)\n"
"    rclcpp::SubscriptionOptions sub_opts;\n"
"    sub_opts.qos_overriding_options = "
"rclcpp::QosOverridingOptions::with_default_policies();\n"
"\n"
"    sub_ = this->create_subscription<std_msgs::msg::String>(\n"
"      \"chatter\",\n"
"      10,\n"
"      [this](std_msgs::msg::String::ConstSharedPtr msg) {\n"
"        RCLCPP_INFO(this->get_logger(), \"Received: '%s'\", msg-"
">data.c_str());\n"
"      },\n"
"      sub_opts);\n"
"  }\n"
"\n"
"private:\n"
"  rclcpp::Publisher<std_msgs::msg::String>::SharedPtr pub_;\n"
"  rclcpp::Subscription<std_msgs::msg::String>::SharedPtr sub_;\n"
"};"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/ROS-Framework/interfaces/topics/Working-with-topics/Configuring-QoS-Overrides.rst:122
#: ../../../source/ROS-Framework/interfaces/topics/Working-with-topics/Configuring-QoS-Overrides.rst:282
#: ../../../source/ROS-Framework/interfaces/topics/Working-with-topics/Configuring-QoS-Overrides.rst:340
#: ../../../source/ROS-Framework/interfaces/topics/Working-with-topics/Configuring-QoS-Overrides.rst:356
msgid "Python"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/ROS-Framework/interfaces/topics/Working-with-topics/Configuring-QoS-Overrides.rst:124
msgid ""
"In Python, import ``QoSOverridingOptions`` from "
"``rclpy.qos_overriding_options``. Pass ``qos_overriding_options`` when "
"calling ``create_publisher`` or ``create_subscription``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/ROS-Framework/interfaces/topics/Working-with-topics/Configuring-QoS-Overrides.rst:127
msgid ""
"import rclpy\n"
"from rclpy.node import Node\n"
"from rclpy.qos_overriding_options import QoSOverridingOptions, "
"QosCallbackResult\n"
"from std_msgs.msg import String\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"class QosConfigurableNode(Node):\n"
"\n"
"    def __init__(self):\n"
"        super().__init__('qos_configurable_node')\n"
"\n"
"        # Enable QoS overrides with default policies (history, depth, "
"reliability) for the publisher\n"
"        self.pub = self.create_publisher(\n"
"            String,\n"
"            'chatter',\n"
"            10,\n"
"            # Adding the following line makes the QoS configurable at run "
"time.\n"
"            qos_overriding_options=QoSOverridingOptions.with_default_policies(\n"
"                callback=self.validate_qos,\n"
"            ),\n"
"        )\n"
"\n"
"        # Enable QoS overrides with default policies (history, depth, "
"reliability) for the subscription\n"
"        self.sub = self.create_subscription(\n"
"            String,\n"
"            'chatter',\n"
"            self.listener_callback,\n"
"            10,\n"
"            # Adding the following line makes the QoS configurable at run "
"time.\n"
"            qos_overriding_options=QoSOverridingOptions.with_default_policies(),\n"
"        )\n"
"\n"
"    def listener_callback(self, msg):\n"
"        self.get_logger().info(f'Received: \"{msg.data}\"')\n"
"\n"
"    def validate_qos(self, qos):\n"
"        result = QosCallbackResult()\n"
"        if qos.depth > 10:\n"
"            result.successful = False\n"
"            result.reason = 'history depth must be 10 or less'\n"
"            return result\n"
"        result.successful = True\n"
"        return result"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/ROS-Framework/interfaces/topics/Working-with-topics/Configuring-QoS-Overrides.rst:174
msgid "Validation callbacks"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/ROS-Framework/interfaces/topics/Working-with-topics/Configuring-QoS-Overrides.rst:176
msgid ""
"A validation callback lets the node author verify whether the user-supplied "
"QoS profile meets application safety requirements. The callback receives the "
"final resolved ``QoS`` profile and returns a result containing a boolean "
"flag ``successful`` and a text ``reason``. If the callback returns "
"``successful = false``, the node initialization fails with an exception "
"(``InvalidQosOverridesException`` in C++, ``InvalidQosOverridesError`` in "
"Python), preventing accidental misconfigurations."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/ROS-Framework/interfaces/topics/Working-with-topics/Configuring-QoS-Overrides.rst:181
msgid "Entity identifiers"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/ROS-Framework/interfaces/topics/Working-with-topics/Configuring-QoS-Overrides.rst:183
msgid ""
"When a single node hosts multiple publishers or subscriptions on the same "
"topic, pass an optional ``id`` or ``entity_id`` to distinguish them. For "
"example, supplying ``entity_id=\"fast_stream\"`` renames the parameter group "
"from ``publisher`` to ``publisher_fast_stream``."
msgstr ""

